{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "Subject for pre-integrated skin (spec 11.13). Three nodes share one unit",
    "sphere at scales 0.5 / 1.0 / 2.0, so curvature is exactly 2.0 / 1.0 / 0.5;",
    "the ellipsoid above them varies curvature continuously across one surface.",
    "",
    "The key is a single directional light and it is deliberately NOT axis",
    "aligned. A directional light pointing exactly down a world axis makes this",
    "geometry shadow itself completely -- the whole lit hemisphere goes black.",
    "Recorded in specs/11.13 phase 0; tilt is the workaround, not the fix.",
    "",
    "Grazing rather than back-lit, unlike sss_scale_fixture.cscn, which puts its",
    "key BEHIND the spheres to reach the back-light transmission accumulator and",
    "is therefore blind to a front-facing falloff. Here the terminator has to sit",
    "on the visible disc of every object at once.",
    "",
    "No environment and no fill: ambient 0 means diffuse past the terminator is",
    "exactly zero, so anything measured there is scatter and nothing else.",
    "",
    "Scatter radius 0.28 puts every object in the CLAMPED regime at the recipe's",
    "resolution (requested kernel 64-76 px against the 48 px cap in",
    "sss_blur_frag.glsl:30). That is on purpose: pre-integration only has work to",
    "do where the screen-space blur cannot deliver the authored width.",
    "",
    "Which is also why the recipe renders at -W 1200 -H 750 rather than the usual",
    "800x500. The blur-to-object RATIO is scale-free -- both scale with",
    "resolution -- so the pixel cap is the only thing that breaks it, and the only",
    "way into the clamped regime is more absolute pixels. Widening the scatter",
    "instead would reach the cap by smearing the small sphere into mush, which is",
    "the same trade the cap itself is making.",
    "",
    "The base material in the .gltf is plain grey; the skin look is authored",
    "here, which is also what exercises the scene file's material overrides."
  ],
  "models": [
    { "path": "skin_curvature_fixture.gltf" }
  ],
  "materials": {
    "skin": {
      "albedo": [0.76, 0.57, 0.48],
      "roughness": 0.45,
      "metallic": 0.0,
      "sss": { "color": [1.0, 0.35, 0.25], "radius": 0.28 }
    }
  },
  "lights": [
    {
      "name": "key",
      "type": "directional",
      "direction": [0.93, -0.26, -0.26],
      "color": [1.0, 0.97, 0.93],
      "intensity": 3.0,
      "cast_shadows": true
    }
  ],
  "camera": { "eye": [-0.2, 0.93, 9.5], "target": [-0.2, 0.93, 0.0], "fov": 40 },
  "post": { "tonemap": "neutral", "exposure": 1.0 }
}
